WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.948
Tom was in the Royal Lab.

2
00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:21.840
He was mixing a potion.

3
00:00:21.841 --> 00:00:26.171
"I need a potion to undo spells," he said.

4
00:00:26.172 --> 00:00:29.335
"I make so many mistakes!"

5
00:00:29.336 --> 00:00:36.320
Cat licked a paw and watched.

6
00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:46.843
Tom mixed water with some herbs.

7
00:00:46.844 --> 00:00:53.820
He added dragon scales and flower petals.

8
00:00:53.821 --> 00:01:02.823
The potion turned bright green.

9
00:01:02.824 --> 00:01:05.672
Princess Mary hurried into the lab.

10
00:01:05.673 --> 00:01:08.267
"Wizard!" she said.

11
00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.072
"I need help!"

12
00:01:10.073 --> 00:01:12.009
Tom bowed quickly.

13
00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:14.016
He bumped his head on the table.

14
00:01:14.017 --> 00:01:16.242
"Ouch!" he cried.

15
00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:18.664
"What's wrong, Princess?"

16
00:01:18.665 --> 00:01:22.164
Princess Mary sighed.

17
00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.796
"Father wants me to get married.

18
00:01:24.797 --> 00:01:28.553
So five princes are coming to the palace tomorrow.

19
00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:32.287
I must choose one for my husband."

20
00:01:32.288 --> 00:01:35.801
"Do you want to get married?" Tom asked.

21
00:01:35.802 --> 00:01:39.610
"Maybe. . ." The princess blushed.

22
00:01:39.611 --> 00:01:42.574
"If one of the princes is nice.

23
00:01:42.575 --> 00:01:46.149
But how can I tell if one is truly nice?"

24
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:49.341
Tom scratched his head.

25
00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:52.001
"That is a problem."

26
00:01:52.002 --> 00:01:55.960
"Can you use magic?" Princess Mary asked.

27
00:01:55.961 --> 00:01:59.071
"You could find the nicest prince for me!"

28
00:01:59.072 --> 00:02:01.363
"Okay," Tom said.

29
00:02:01.364 --> 00:02:02.991
"I will try!"

30
00:02:02.992 --> 00:02:05.924
He bowed again.

31
00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:09.000
This time he knocked over the potion.

32
00:02:09.001 --> 00:02:12.272
It spilled on the table.

33
00:02:12.273 --> 00:02:17.999
Poof! The table disappeared.

34
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:24.768
"Oops!" Tom's face turned bright red.

35
00:02:24.769 --> 00:02:27.951
Princess Mary smiled at Tom.

36
00:02:27.952 --> 00:02:30.434
"Thank you, Tom," she said.

37
00:02:30.435 --> 00:02:41.637
"You are a very kind wizard!"
